==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the stage by summoning meatshields because you don't want the Shy Boy to hit your base. Then summon your [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]] to deal damage to the Shy Boys and eventually killing them. You don't need [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel units]] but it is recommended.

